<title>USA: US stocks end weaker in mild correction.</title>
<headline>US stocks end weaker in mild correction.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average edged lower Thursday as some investors took profits.</p>
<p>Based on early and unofficial data, the 30-share index fell 11.55 points to close at 6,418.47. In the broader market, advancing issues were about even with declines on active volume of 469 million shares on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
